-- Baseline migration. Establishes Flyway ownership of the schema; feature tables are added by
-- later, module-specific migrations (V2 identity and organization, ...).
--
-- Conventions for every migration:
--   * UUID primary keys, generated by the application (time-ordered) or gen_random_uuid().
--   * Timestamps are TIMESTAMPTZ and stored in UTC.
--   * Every foreign key column is indexed unless a composite index already leads with it.
--   * Migrations are immutable once merged: fix forward with a new version.
COMMENT ON SCHEMA public IS 'CloudForge application schema. Managed by Flyway; do not edit by hand.';
